# Local gate profile specs (traced off customer drawings -- never in this
# public repo). ``core/spec_source.py`` shows the local-load UI only when
# this path resolves to a directory, so this ignore rule is what keeps the
# feature from ever existing on a deployed instance. Do not remove it.
local_specs
local_specs/

